2. WHY FETCH DATA FROM AN API?
================================================================================

HARDCODED DATA
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Data stored directly in application code
- Static data
- Must be updated manually
- Limited scalability


API DATA
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Data comes from an external service
- Dynamic content
- Can access large datasets
- Easier to maintain
- Common in real-world applications


