14. WHY USE OPTIONAL CHAINING?
================================================================================

API data may contain missing fields.

Unsafe:

book.volumeInfo.authors.join(', ')


If authors does not exist, the code can fail.


Safer:

book.volumeInfo?.authors?.join(', ')


Example:

book.volumeInfo?.title || 'No Title'

book.volumeInfo?.authors?.join(', ') || 'Unknown Author'

book.volumeInfo?.publisher || 'Unknown Publisher'


Optional Chaining:

?.


Purpose:

Safely access nested properties that may be missing.


