22. COMMON ISSUES
================================================================================

ISSUE: books IS EMPTY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Check:

console.log(data);

The response may not contain items.

Use:

setBooks(data.items || []);


ISSUE: PAGE CRASHES WHEN AUTHORS ARE MISSING
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Avoid:

book.volumeInfo.authors.join(', ')

Use:

book.volumeInfo?.authors?.join(', ')
  || 'Unknown Author';


ISSUE: HTTP ERROR NOT ENTERING catch
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Check:

if (!response.ok) {
  throw new Error(
    `HTTP error! Status: ${response.status}`
  );
}


ISSUE: API RUNS REPEATEDLY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Check the useEffect dependency array.

For a fetch intended only on initial mount:

useEffect(() => {
  fetchBooks();
}, []);


ISSUE: LOADING NEVER STOPS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Use:

finally {
  setIsLoading(false);
}


